# Copy to .env.local and fill in (restart the server after changing it).
# NEVER commit your real token — .env.local is git-ignored.

# --- Extraction credentials (one of these two) -----------------------------

# Option A — third-party Anthropic-compatible gateway (Bearer token):
ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=your-gateway-token-here
ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://your-gateway.example.com
# No trailing slash needed; "/v1/messages" is appended automatically.

# Option B — direct Anthropic key (x-api-key):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Which model the gateway should use. Pick one your gateway actually serves.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-haiku-20241022

# --- Behavior note -----------------------------------------------------------
# If no credentials are set, or the LLM call fails for ANY reason (bad token,
# unsupported model, rate limit, network), the pipeline silently falls back to
# the local heuristic PDF parser. Nothing about the failure is shown in the UI;
# the verdict card just tags the extraction source as "heuristic" instead of "llm".
